T | 0 |  | 0\\n2 | work_order_id | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\\n3 | contract_no | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\\n4 | customer_id | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\\n5 | product_id | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\\n6 | packaged_goods | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\\n7 | quantity | INTEGER | 0 |  | 0\\n8 | unit | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\\n9 | contract_amount | REAL | 0 |  | 0\\n10 | created_at | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\\n11 | promised_delivery_at | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\\n12 | delivery_basis | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\\n13 | route_id | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\\n14 | fulfillment_mode | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\\n15 | order_source | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\\n16 | source_risk_flag | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\\n17 | source_risk_reason | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\\n18 | sales_owner | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\\n19 | source_sheet | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\\n20 | source_row | INTEGER | 0 |  | 0\\n21 | is_effective | INTEGER | 0 |  | 0\\n22 | data_origin | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\\n23 | snapshot_at | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\\n(24 rows)\\n=== shipments ===\\ncid | name | type | notnull | dflt_value | pk\\n----------------------------------------\\n0 | shipment_id | TEXT | 0 |  | 1\\n1 | sales_order_id | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\\n2 | work_order_id | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\\n3 | route_id | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\\n4 | carrier | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\\n5 | tracking_no | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\\n6 | quantity | INTEGER | 0 |  | 0\\n7 | unit | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\\n8 | dispatched_at | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\\n9 | carrier_promised_at | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\\n10 | received_at | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\\n11 | freight_cost | INTEGER | 0 |  | 0\\n12 | status | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\\n(13 rows)\", \"id\": \"b31682c1288b407292e4a98e20e09d88\", \"created_at\": \"2026-09-17T22:49:36.585007\", \"finished_at\": null}], \"state\": \"success\", \"metadata\": {}, \"created_at\": \"2026-09-17T22:49:36.586477\", \"finished_at\": null}, {\"type\": \"tool_result\", \"id\": \"call_4bf4c0b1bcc7494bacda46a6\", \"name\": \"execute_shell_command\", \"output\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"根据检索到的信息，以下是查询“已交付订单”及“全量签收”相关的 SQL 示例与字段说明：\\n\\n### 1. 核心数据表与字段\\n*   **`order_progress` (订单进度表)**：用于判断订单是否全量签收。\\n    *   `received_quantity`：签收数量 <