n```\\n*注：此查询用于获取有效订单列表，若需关联签收状态，建议通过 `sales_order_id` 或 `work_order_id` 与 `order_progress` 表进行 JOIN <kb doc=\\\"查询入门_示例SQL.md\\\" chunk_id=\\\"d16e530f-618b-4946-b2f7-784de5bea6e9\\\" kb_id=\\\"4a945ef5-5157-41ca-b6f2-79fa1452f382\\\" />。*\\n\\n#### 示例 C：检查库存签收数量（WMS 层面）\\n如果需要从仓库交易明细中验证签收数量（已归一化）：\\n\\n```sql\\nSELECT \\n    warehouse_id,\\n    lot_id,\\n    material_id,\\n    product_id,\\n    ROUND(SUM(signed_quantity),6) AS balance\\nFROM wms_transactions\\n=== 查询入门.sql ===\\n-- Query examples; run against agent_data.sqlite (read-only recommended).\\n-- 1. Effective orders. Future examples are excluded.\\nSELECT sales_order_id, work_order_id, customer_id, product_id, quantity, unit, promised_delivery_at\\nFROM v_current_orders\\nLIMIT 20;\\n\\n-- 2. Stock at warehouse / lot / item grain. Signed quantities are already normalized.\\nSELECT warehouse_id,lot_id,material_id,product_id,\\n       ROUND(SUM(signed_quantity),6) AS balance\\nFROM wms_transactions\\nGROUP BY warehouse_id,lot_id,material_id,product_id\\nORDER BY warehouse_id,lot_id;\\n\\n-- 3. Observe schema before choosing columns and JOIN keys.\\nPRAGMA table_info(stage_nodes);\\nPRAGMA table_info(shipments);\\nPRAGMA foreign_key_list(work_orders);\\n\\n-- Do not join multiple fact tables directly and then SUM.\\n-- Aggregate labor, warehouse movements and freight separately to sales_order_id first.\", \"id\": \"12e22eea8c8b43ac827f56e9933d4821\", \"created_at\": \"2026-09-17T22:49:50.705790\", \"finished_at\": null}], \"state\": \"success\", \"metadata\": {}, \"created_at\": \"2026-09-17T22:49:50.707466\", \"finished_at\": null}, {\"type\": \"thinking\", \"thinking\": \"The KB mentions `order_progress` table but the actual sqlite has no such table (30 tables listed, no order_progress). So I need to compute from shipments: order complete = full sign-off (received_at not null and cumulative received quantity == order quantity).\\n\\nNote: orders table has order_line_id — so orders may have multiple lines 